<!-- A WEEK AT SEA REACH -->
<section class="section section-sand" id="week">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="fade-in" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
            <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-center">YOUR WEEK</div>
            <h2 class="text-center">A Week at Sea Reach</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 55% 42%; gap: 48px; align-items: start;" class="fade-in week-layout">
            <div class="week-text">
                <p>You pull into the driveway on Saturday and start unloading the car. The kids are already arguing about who gets the bunk room. You open the front door, drop the cooler in the kitchen, and notice the beach badges sitting on the counter — eight of them, ready to go. The chairs and umbrellas are in the garage. You haven't been here five minutes, and tomorrow is already handled.</p>
                <p>By Sunday morning, you've found your rhythm. Coffee on the wraparound porch while the house is still quiet. The beach is a four-minute walk, and you're learning to take it slow — flip-flops, towels over shoulders, no rush. The kids sprint ahead. You let them.</p>
                <p>The afternoons take care of themselves. Someone fires up the grill. The ping pong table in the garage becomes the most popular spot in the house. By evening, everyone ends up around the fire pit — sandy, sunburned, happy. The kind of tired that comes from a day with absolutely nothing on the schedule.</p>
                <p>By Wednesday, you realize you haven't moved the car. You don't need to. The boardwalk is a short walk. The beach is right there. The house has everything. Somewhere around Thursday, someone says it —</p>
                <div class="pull-quote">"Can we just come back every year?"</div>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
                    <a href="#story" class="btn-secondary">Meet the Family Behind Sea Reach</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <Image
                    src={backyardSlipNSlide}
                    alt="Kids playing in the backyard at Sea Reach"
                    style="aspect-ratio: 3/4; border-radius: 20px; object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: auto;"
                    format="webp"
                    quality={85}
                    loading="lazy"
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- OUR STORY -->
<section class="section section-white" id="story">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="story-grid fade-in">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">OUR FAMILY</div>
                <h2>Three Generations of Jersey Shore Summers</h2>
                <p class="subheadline" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">The D'Alessandro family has been making shore memories since before the boardwalk had arcades.</p>
                <div class="story-text">
                    <p>The Jersey Shore has been the place we call home in the summer for generations.</p>
                    <p>My grandparents had a beach house just down the shore since my mother was little — five kids crammed into three bedrooms for two months with zero A/C, loving every minute of it.</p>
                    <p>My dad ran stands on Jenkinson's boardwalk in college. That's where he first met my mom. My sister and I grew up in that same beach house, squeezing in with all our cousins, sandy feet and all. We'd fish with my grandfather, paint seashells with my grandmother, and stay on the beach until someone rang the dinner bell.</p>
                    <p>Our summers were filled with sea glass, sandcastles, and sun-kissed memories.</p>
                    <p>So it's only fitting that we continue the tradition with our own beach house. (Don't worry — this one has A/C.)</p>
                    <p>We hope your days here are just as memorable as ours, and that you'll come back each summer to make more.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="story-signature">— The D'Alessandro Family</div>
                <div style="margin-top: 32px;">
                    <a href="#zones" class="btn-secondary">Explore the House</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="story-images">
                <div class="story-img">
                    <Image
                        src={familyPhoto}
                        alt="The D'Alessandro Family at the Jersey Shore"
                        style="aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
                        format="webp"
                        quality={85}
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                </div>
                <div class="story-img">
                    <Image
                        src={lastWave}
                        alt="Shore lifestyle at Point Pleasant Beach"
                        style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
                        format="webp"
                        quality={85}
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- NINE ZONES -->
<section class="section section-sand" id="zones">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="fade-in" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
            <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-center">ROOM FOR EVERYONE</div>
            <h2 class="text-center">Nine Places to Be. One House to Love.</h2>
            <p class="subheadline subheadline-center" style="margin-top: 16px;">Every family beach rental makes the same promise — "plenty of space." Sea Reach actually delivers. Nine distinct zones, each with its own personality, so every age group finds their spot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="zones-grid fade-in">
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={frontCouch} alt="The Wraparound Porch lounge at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Wraparound Porch</h3>
                    <p>Morning coffee before anyone else is awake. Evening reading with the sound of the neighborhood settling down. Temperature-controlled, enclosed, and the quietest seat in the house — until the kids find you.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={livingRoomOppo} alt="Open living room with couch and porch view" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Living Room</h3>
                    <p>The hub. Hardwood floors, big couch, TV, and the kind of open layout where you can see everyone without being on top of them. This is where the whole house ends up at the end of the day.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={kitchen} alt="Gourmet kitchen with granite counters" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Kitchen</h3>
                    <p>Granite counters, gas stove, and everything you need to cook real meals on vacation. The kind of kitchen that makes you actually want to eat in — and you will.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="zones-grid fade-in">
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={diningRoomFull} alt="Dining room table set for eight at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Dining Room</h3>
                    <p>A real dining room with a table that seats eight — not a breakfast bar with stools. Modern light fixture, hardwood floors, and the spot where every vacation meal becomes a memory.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={garageGameroom} alt="The Garage Lounge with ping pong" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Garage Lounge</h3>
                    <p>The secret weapon. Ping pong, TV, and a full hangout space that becomes the most popular room in the house. Perfect for sandy kids, teens who want their own world, or a rainy-afternoon refuge.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap zone-img-split">
                    <Image src={office2} alt="Upstairs office workspace at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                    <Image src={porchDesk} alt="Downstairs office workspace at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" style="object-position: 30% center;" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>Two Office Nooks</h3>
                    <p>Two dedicated workspaces — one upstairs, one down. Real desks, real chairs, real WiFi. Not a kitchen counter with a laptop. Need to check in on vacation? At least do it from a proper desk.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="zones-grid fade-in">
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={outdoorSeatsFirePit} alt="Fire pit with seating at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Fire Pit</h3>
                    <p>Where the best conversations happen. Gas fire pit with comfortable seating — by night three, this becomes the family ritual. Kids catching fireflies, adults telling stories, everyone winding down together.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={outdoorDining} alt="Outdoor dining area at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>Outdoor Dining</h3>
                    <p>Private patio dining with the Weber grill steps away. Once you eat dinner outside with the evening breeze, you won't want to go back to the table inside. Most families don't.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card zone-card">
                <div class="zone-img-wrap">
                    <Image src={houseBackyard} alt="The backyard at Sea Reach" class="zone-img" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3>The Backyard</h3>
                    <p>Slip-n-slide territory. Space for kids to run, outdoor shower to rinse off the sand, and the kind of breathing room that makes the house feel twice as big.</p>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="zone-gallery-link">View in gallery</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-in" style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #4a4a4a; margin-bottom: 32px;">Most 4-bedroom rentals have a living room and a deck. Sea Reach has nine spaces for different moods, different times of day, and different people. Two families sharing? Kids in the garage, adults by the fire. Everyone's happy.</p>
            <a href="#bedrooms" class="btn-secondary">See the Bedrooms</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

